// kagan: end


// sb fireworks: begin
// Super Brainz's Firework Out (PvZ BfN), a wheel gesture: its icon, the rocket (the anim's markup attaches it), the
// anim (its notetracks play the effects and the sounds: support.all, shield_sbfw_*), the effects, the two gestures,
// the wheel item, the game's wheel item list with it last (it replaces core_common's: the support config's
// "override"). BO4 Custom Maps/Fireworks Gesture (BO4)/tools/build_sb_fireworks.py writes this block: edit it there
